    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12760" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκαρτερ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>kill oneself by abstinence, starve oneself to death,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				56
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀποκαρτερῶν,</span> title of
			work by <i><span class="en">
				Hegesias
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Tusc.</u>
				1.34.84
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Num.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Macr.</u>
				19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οῦντα ἀποθνῄσκειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Mort.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥστε μᾶλλον ἂν θέλειν ἀποκαρτερεῖν
					ἢ τοῦτ᾽ ἀκούων καρτερεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					336.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἀπεκαρτέρησε . ., ἀλλ᾽ ἐκαρτέρησ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Timocl.
					18
				</span></i>
			.</div>
